    /// <param name="eventInitDict">WebIDL 参数 eventInitDict：PopStateEventInit。可省略。WebIDL 默认值：{&#10;                      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;dictionary&quot;&#10;                    }。 <see href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/PopStateEvent/PopStateEvent">MDN Web Docs: eventInitDict</see></param>
public extern PopStateEvent(string type, PopStateEventInit? eventInitDict = default);

