    /// <summary>
    /// Experimental: This is an experimental technologyCheck the Browser compatibility table carefully before using this in production. The createCubeLayer() method of the XRWebGLBinding interface returns an XRCubeLayer object, which is a layer that renders directly from a cubemap, and projects it onto the inside faces of a cube.
    /// </summary>
