/// <summary>
/// Secure context: This feature is available only in secure contexts (HTTPS), in some or all supporting browsers. The OrientationSensor interface of the Sensor APIs is the base class for orientation sensors. This interface cannot be used directly. Instead it provides properties and methods accessed by interfaces that inherit from it. This feature may be blocked by a Permissions Policy set on your server.
