    /// <param name="policyOptions">User-defined functions for converting strings into trusted values. createHTML(input[,args]) A callback function in the form of a string that contains code to run when creating a TrustedHTML object. createScript(input[,args]) A callback function in the form of a string that contains code to run when creating a TrustedScript object. createScriptURL(input[,args]) A callback function in the form of a string that contains code to run when creating a TrustedScriptURL object. <see href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/TrustedTypePolicyFactory/createPolicy">MDN Web Docs: policyOptions</see></param>
