    /// <summary>
    /// Experimental: This is an experimental technologyCheck the Browser compatibility table carefully before using this in production. Note: This feature is available in Web Workers. The getAll() method of the ContentIndex interface returns a Promise that resolves with an iterable list of content index entries.
