    /// <param name="options">An object specifying configuration options for the summarizeStreaming() operation. Possible values include: context A string describing the context the input text is being used in, which helps the Summarizer generate a more suitable summary. signal An AbortSignal object instance, which allows the summarizeStreaming() operation to be aborted via the associated AbortController. <see href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Summarizer/summarizeStreaming">MDN Web Docs: options</see></param>
    /// <returns>A ReadableStream containing the generated summary.</returns>
