    /// <param name="options">An object specifying configuration options for the measureInputUsage() operation. Possible values include: context A string describing the context the input text would be used in, to help generate a more suitable summary. signal An AbortSignal object instance, which allows the measureInputUsage() operation to be aborted via the associated AbortController. <see href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Summarizer/measureInputUsage">MDN Web Docs: options</see></param>
    /// <returns>A Promise that fulfills with a number specifying the inputQuota usage of the given input text.</returns>
