    /// <param name="modeRGB">A GLenum specifying how source and destination RGB color components are combined. Accepts the same enums as the modeRGB parameter in WebGLRenderingContext.blendEquationSeparate(). <see href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/OES_draw_buffers_indexed/blendEquationSeparateiOES">MDN Web Docs: modeRGB</see></param>
