    /// <summary>
    /// The TimeEvent.detail read-only property provides contextual information about the event, depending on the event type. For repeatEvent events, detail contains the current repeat iteration as a non-negative integer. Because the event is not raised for the first iteration, the value will always be 1 or greater. For beginEvent and endEvent events, detail is always 0.
    /// </summary>
