    /// <param name="detailArg">WebIDL 参数 detailArg：long。可省略。WebIDL 默认值：0。 <see href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/TimeEvent/initTimeEvent">MDN Web Docs: detailArg</see></param>
